        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right, with `unaccent` and `pg_trgm`."
      },
      {
        "text": "`ILIKE` with a bigger server",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Still misses accents and typos."
      },
      {
        "text": "A search service from a third party",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Possible, not the first suggestion."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
